The Kombat [[FFA]] 2 event is a standalone event with a €1500 prize pool to start the new year 2022! This is the second [[FFA]] Kombat event, where the initial idea is to take several new maps and make a showcase of it on a good stream. This time we got some more familiar maps, along with some classics as well. Here is the Kombat [http://discord.gg/2qkVVan724 discord server]

